WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.400
Good morning, Ichiko!

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.780
Huh? Who are you?

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.570
Oh, come on! It's me, me!

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.850
Momiji, the God of Misfortune!

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:18.350
Huh?

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.000
What?!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.010
Hey, do you see that?

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.010
That's Binbouda... right?

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.970
She seems totally different than usual.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.270
She's like a completely different person!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.440
Here I go!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.530
Something's up.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:19.030
What should I do? What should I do?
The hell is this?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.830
All because we made her take a bath?

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:24.080
Is this the result of some special training?

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.040
She's just putting on an act like usual, right?

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.000
Should I just devote myself to karate?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.500
Teddy too?!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.920
Oh, it's so cute!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.050
Teddy's just radiating cuteness all of a sudden!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.050
It's moving! How's it moving?

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.430
Wait a second, what's he doing at school?!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:48.480
I must apologize to you for saying such a terrible things.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.440
Binbouda is amazing!

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.610
Her pronunciation is so good!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.790
I continued my job hunt,

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.210
even while being ridiculed by brats like you.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.880
Who knew that Binbouda could be so cute?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.750
Starting today, I am the school's dictator.
I might have to change my tastes.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.010
The fuck? What about Miss Sakura?!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:19.920
You traitor!

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.260
I didn't say I would for sure!

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.890
Man, you guys are so crude!

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.430
You really have no tact at all!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.310
Shut the hell up!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:32.440
Hey guys, come on. Let's keep it clean.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.980
That's right! We have no interest in punks like you!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:39.320
Ranmaru's more of a man than you'll ever be!

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.400
H-Huh?

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.360
Cut it out, you guys!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.580
Please stop fighting!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:51.250
Come on, we're in the middle of class!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.170
We're in high school now.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:56.170
About time we started conducting
ourselves like adults, don't you think?

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.380
W-We're getting...

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.300
...lectured by Binbouda...

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.220
<i>Never thought I'd hear that from </i>you<i>, of all people!</i>

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.470
All right! If you please, let's continue the lesson.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:14.190
<i>No one's ever cared about me until now...</i>

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.190
I'm so moved!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.070
The teacher abandoned the class!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.320
That didn't help at all.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.860
Oh shoot, this all because you guys started fighting.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.950
No, it was you.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:25.700
On that note,

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.780
I have something to say to the boys.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.540
Huh? To us?

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:35.500
It's great that you're all so nice to Ichiko, but I don't think it should be just her.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:42.130
Boys should be equally nice to everyone, not just the girls they like.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.130
She's blinding!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.970
Aren't you supposed to be a God of Misfortune?!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:49.430
If you can't even manage that, don't expect that girl you like to return the favor!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:52.350
You tell 'em, Binbouda!

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.640
You girls shouldn't be talking either, should you?

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.310
Huh?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.770
You're always treating Ranmaru like a boy.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.530
No girl likes being treated like a guy, does she?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.240
Eh...

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.110
I guess...

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.780
I don't really mind.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.160
Please observe!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.740
See! Look how feminine she is!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.410
Huh? When did you—

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.750
Gadget of Misfortune: Costube!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.750
Just wave it over someone and they'll change clothes in an instant!

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.010
It's limited to outfits they've already worn once, though.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:25.170
No way! Ranmaru? That's so cute!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.300
Uh.. Yeah.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.930
This is...

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.680
So, how about it? Don't you think she's cute, Tsuwabuki?

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.390
Huh?

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.940
Uh... sure. Looks great.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.060
I do think she's cute.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.030
This is beyond just being moved!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.530
Ranmaru!!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.410
What is life?

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.290
What is happinesss?!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.790
Oh no... Did I do something else I shouldn't have?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.920
<i>You stupid god...</i>

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.380
Damn her!

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.130
What's she after this time?

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.550
He said I was cute!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.300
Get a hold of yourself, Ranmaru!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.510
Now I can die with no regrets!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.220
<i>We're talking about a God of Misfortune here.</i>

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.600
<i>She's definitely planning something.</i>

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.610
<i>Maybe she's pretending be a good girl so she can get the class on her side?</i>

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:21.690
<i>Or could it be...</i>

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.230
I'm back!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.400
Oh, Ranmaru's here too!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:31.820
Lookie look! All the meat was half-price!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:35.290
All right, Ranmaru's here too, so tonight's gonna be a treat!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:35.790
Ow ow ow ow ow ow ow ow!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.290
Have you no shame?

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.540
How dare you barge into my house like this!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:42.130
And is that my uniform?!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.340
I don't know what you're scheming,

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.050
but how about you put a stop to that shitty acting already?

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.300
Acting?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.180
That's right!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:53.760
Oh, sorry! I forgot to tell you!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:58.230
When Gods of Misfortune and their familiars,

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.900
like me and Teddy, come to the human world,

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.610
we lose all of our powers if we get cleaned up!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:04.650
What?

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:08.240
And our personalities change too!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.700
What the hell is that?!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.860
And that's how it is!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.620
Let's be friends from now on, okay?

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.080
Cute!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.500
<i>When she loses her powers, her personality changes too?</i>

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.960
<i>Is that really true?</i>

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.380
<i>Isn't this just a part of her plan?</i>

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:30.130
<i>That's right! I've figured it out! I've seen through your scheme!</i>

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.140
<i>She wants me to think she's turned all nice and friendly,</i>

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.310
<i>but it's really all an act.</i>

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.520
<i>I know she knows that the moment I relax and let my guard down,</i>

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.520
<i>she'll go straight for my Fortune.</i>

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.730
Ichiko.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:46.520
Do you really think I'm here
to take away your Fortune?

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.530
Do I seem like that kind of person?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.990
You do. I can tell.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:56.830
<i>You plan to reveal your true colors just before killing me, don't you?</i>

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.290
<i>Everything is part of your act.</i>

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.960
<i>Your eyes betray your arrogance.</i>

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.580
Suwano...

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.460
Ichiko!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.260
<i>God of Misfortune...</i>

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:24.100
<i>I knew it... I was right... all along...</i>

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.770
Ichiko! Hey, Ichiko!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.780
<i>I can read you like a book! That's gotta be it!</i>

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.360
Now that I've figured it out...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:32.950
Huh?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:36.280
I'm a little hesitant, but it's time to call <i>them</i>.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.450
Oh, you two came as well?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:45.620
That's great! I made too much, anyway. Won't you join us!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:49.250
This isn't Miss Momiji! This isn't Miss Momiji!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.420
Momou, you didn't know?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.220
Which one is cuter, I wonder?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.300
And? What should we do?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:02.810
Hmm. She says her personality's changed because she lost her powers,

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:06.480
but I think it's just a ruse to take my Fortune.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:12.940
That's why I want you to use your pervert skills to unmask her.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.110
I like where this is going.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:20.030
I'll do anything to return Miss Momiji to normal!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:20.830
All right!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.250
Then first, I shall administer shock treatment!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:28.000
What do you mean, 'shock treatment?' Oh...

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.710
Lemme have a piece of that!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.550
You asshole monk!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.170
You've already defiled Miss Ichiko,

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.670
and now you plan to sink your dirty fangs into Miss Momiji as well?!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:39.010
I'll allow it! Go forth, perverted warrior!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.510
Guess... who...

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.930
it is!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.480
Um.. that voice would be...

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.440
Bobby!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.650
Bingo!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.360
S-She got me!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:56.360
What the hell was that? Lost your nerve?!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.490
What exactly am I supposed to grope?!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.660
And besides! Her aura is too pure!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.580
I can't violate something like that!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.460
Pre-emptive regret?

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.370
Oh? Then what the hell am I?!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:11.790
You groped me without hesitation, so what does that make me?!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.040
No comment!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.460
Stand aside!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.170
It's my turn now!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.840
I just have to get Momiji back to usual, right?

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.090
Ranmaru! Did you think of something?

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:25.100
I just know that if we wish from the bottom of our hearts for Momiji to return to normal,

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.980
our feelings will reach her one day!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:30.230
Well, that's my bad for expecting anything at all.
Even if it takes ten years, or even twenty!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.230
Come, come.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.070
Looks like it's up to me, Miss Momiji's lowest servant.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:36.780
Momou!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:38.860
Huh?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.700
Someone did all these horrible things to you again.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.870
Poor thing. You're all bruised.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.790
If something's wrong, you have to tell someone, okay?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.040
Uh.. Wha—

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.250
Miss... Momiji?

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:56.880
Boo-boo, go away...

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.840
Her kindness is terrifying!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.470
So the one thing that masochist couldn't endure was kindness.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.850
Try not to break any more windows, okay?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.890
There's seconds for everyone and then some!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.350
Whoa!

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.940
Delicious!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.610
What do you say, you two?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.230
Thanks for the food!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.400
You guys aren't eating?

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.780
Don't want any, you traitors.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.280
She already made all this food, you know?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.410
We can think about turning her back after we eat.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:29.200
Not to mention, isn't this better for you too?

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.500
I mean...

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.460
You too, Kitty?!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.340
Hey, come eat with us.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.960
I made this because I wanted you to enjoy it, Ichiko.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.800
I said I didn't want any!

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:46.100
And what about how you're not a God of
Misfortune now because you lost your powers?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.770
Doesn't that mean you don't have to stick around me anymore?!

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.310
Not quite!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.850
Even though I've lost my powers,
that doesn't mean my mission is over.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:57.230
Your "mission?!" I'm not draining other people's Fortune anymore!

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.110
I have this keystone now!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.740
You put it on yourself! I'm proud of you.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.370
But I still haven't gotten <i>your</i> Fortune.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:09.750
Wouldn't you want to distribute your Fortune to those who need it most?

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.580
Why would I?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.830
There's nothing more wonderful than helping those in need!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:14.420
Listen to me!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.790
Now... and forever...

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.250
Let's give it all we've got, okay?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.170
Where are you getting this "we" from?!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.390
But let's stop arguing for now, all right?

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.140
C'mon, just try a little bit.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.850
Like I said...

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.930
I don't want any!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.530
Momiji!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.570
Ah... she made her cry.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.360
Of course, after she did that...

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.950
But... I...

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.160
Ichiko!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.700
Go after her! Right now!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.040
<i>Why?!</i>

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:14.520
<i>Why do I have to get yelled at by Ranmaru?</i>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.400
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.780
<i>Why do I have to go after this God of Misfortune?</i>

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:24.860
G...

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.990
God of Misfortune!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.490
Ichiko...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:35.210
Um... Yeah...

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.210
Let's go back.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:40.590
Really?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.090
Don't get me wrong!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.380
I'm only doing this because Ranmaru told me to!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:49.090
I-It's not like I want to be friends with you or anything!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.720
Thank you.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.690
Seriously...

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.520
What are you, anyway?

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.690
You suddenly appear in front of me...

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.200
toss my life into a mess...

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.860
and now you want to be friends?

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.740
How far do you plan on abusing me?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:13.370
I'm sorry.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.410
Don't apologize! That just makes it worse.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.710
I just... want you to understand this.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.960
Whatever my usual appearance or attitude may be...

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:31.050
As I am right now... I don't want you to be unhappy.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:31.930
What are you talking about?

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.930
Just before, you were going on about how you needed to take my Fortune!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.640
Doesn't that mean you want to make me unhappy?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:41.560
Taking it by force isn't the only way to return Fortune to where it belongs.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.570
Oh, is that it then? You want me to voluntarily share it with others?

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:48.650
You're persistent, aren't you? I have no interest in being some kind of saint!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.910
How many times have I told you?

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:53.740
I don't give a damn about anyone except Suwano and Ranmaru!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.080
Wasn't it just Suwano before?

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.420
Isn't that right? You shared your Fortune, but you didn't lose anything, right?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.050
Of course, I'm not saying you have to make a hundred friends right away.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.710
Every little bit helps.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.760
Little by little,

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.930
if you make friends that are important to you,

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:15.760
I just know you'll find a new kind of happiness you never knew before.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.680
W-Wait...

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:21.560
In the end... the Fortune you give out will come back to you as happiness.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.230
A-Alright! I get what you're saying!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.860
I don't want to talk about it anymore.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:34.240
Let's go back. I don't want Ranmaru to give me another earful.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.620
Welcome back.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.250
Thanks.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:48.340
You two are soaked. Hop in the bath, it's ready.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.220
Sorry for just going ahead without asking you first.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.260
No, no, it's fine. Thanks, Ranmaru.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.050
And...

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.560
What's all this about?!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:04.440
Huh? You wouldn't want poor Momiji to
catch a cold waiting for you to finish, right?

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.690
Why do I have to bathe with her?!

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.530
Ichiko, let's wash each others' backs!

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.610
Like hell we should!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:16.070
If you try and attack me or something, I'll kill you.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.490
I won't!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:21.460
Hey Ichiko, about what we were just talking about...

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:25.250
About people who are important to me? You still have more to say?

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.670
Yeah. Someday...

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:32.840
when you've made lots of friends and you're surrounded by people you care about...

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:37.140
If I'm still with you when that happens, well...

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:41.100
Someday... and I really mean someday, whenever it happens...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:47.150
Call me by my name too, okay?

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:49.650
Y-Y...

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.450
Yeah, like that'd ever happen!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.740
Oh, no! Ichiko got mad again!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.200
Hey!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:03.580
<i>In the end, the God of Misfortune showed no signs of returning back to her old self,</i>

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:07.380
<i>and her attacks became a thing of the past.</i>

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:11.760
<i>My life went back to the way it was
when there was no God of Misfortune.</i>

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.590
<i>To peace.</i>

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.090
<i>But, what is this feeling?</i>

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:22.520
<i>Peace is well and good, but something felt missing.</i>

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.600
<i>I guess it's hard not to feel that way.</i>

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.780
<i>Miss Ichiko, too...</i>

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:38.320
<i>It won't be like this forever...
will it, Miss Momiji?</i>

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.250
Hey, that's too far!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.210
Sorry, Ryuu!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.840
Oh... did I hit something?

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:58.720
Hm? What's wrong?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.560
Uh.. this kitty's trying to get in the trash.

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.930
Maybe it can smell some food?

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:07.520
Huh?

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.950
M-M-Monster!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.170
Wh-Whoa! I-It's Teddy, isn't it?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.420
You've returned to normal! But how?

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.170
I see!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:37.920
Then...

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:44.260
All right!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.520
Ichiko!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.850
Let's go back together!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:54.360
Can we come over today?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.650
Should I make some cake?

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.990
Those three sure have been close lately.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.070
They're so charming.

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.500
Ichiko! Hurry up!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.720
Right-o! Dishes, done!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:22.260
Next is the toilet, the bath...

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.940
What's wrong, Kitty?

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.150
Here I come, through the window!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.860
Please forgive me, Miss Momiji!

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:38.440
Momou!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.150
What're you—

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.780
What's going on?!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.950
Teddy?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.250
Wait, you're back to normal?

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.170
Momou, what's going on?

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:55.000
I apologize for the violence, Miss Ichiko!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.550
I will now turn Miss Momiji back into a God of Misfortune!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.680
Turn back?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.260
H-How?

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.850
What the fuck?!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.020
Where do you think you are?

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.610
Why, you!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.480
The Soumin Shourai!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.360
Yessir!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.110
Wait, Momou!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:27.120
Please... I won't run away, so let me down.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:31.870
Let me say goodbye to Ichiko.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.550
Y-You...

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:43.590
I probably won't be like this ever again.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:48.430
The normal Momiji doesn't think too highly of me, you see.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:52.520
It might have only been for a little while, but we had fun.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.150
I truly...

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.690
wanted to be your friend.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.740
Bye-bye, Ichiko.

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.500
Don't be too hard on the normal Momiji, okay? For me.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.460
G...

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.170
God of Misfortune...

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:56.810
Boss.

00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:59.770
There's a monk here who's looking for work.

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:01.690
Huh? Sure, I guess...

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:03.610
Got a license?

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:07.530
If you can drive, the sake deliveries will be much easier.

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:10.660
Delivering on a bike is hard work, isn't it, Tsuwabuki?

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.700
You got a license?

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:14.240
Sure, I got one. Here.

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:17.290
Right then. We'll be counting on you.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.540
Tsuwabuki, stop!

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.000
Yes we can!

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:23.000
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga</i>!

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:27.010
N-Next week is... the finale...

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.220
Shinobu! We can't afford to be careless!

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:33.390
If I don't get a scene, I'll take one myself!

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:37.640
Next week, I'll teach you all a lesson!
